        "TileImage": "$($repository 0bcfaa18-66ca-4f98-9639-d5eebce519bb).Image",
        "Description": "Mr. Juoin&apos;s request to eliminate Mr. Gilbert had been authorized. The discordant note played at the Royal Albert Hall had shattered more than the music - it had tainted the atmosphere and Mr. Juoin&apos;s favorite song, &apos;Ave Maria,&apos; now carried a bitter sting. The client was greatly displeased. The contract is in place, and the time has come to demonstrate to Mr. Gilbert the efficient use of a piano wire.",
